#Friday

text:
{ إن الله ومَلائكته يُصلون على النَّبي ياأيُها الذين آمنُوا صَلوا عليه وَسَلِّموا تَسليماً }
اللهم صلِ وسلم على نبينا محمدﷺ

#يوم_Iلجمعه

Text_original:
{ إن الله ومَلائكته يُصلون على النَّبي ياأيُها الذين آمنُوا صَلوا عليه وَسَلِّموا تَسليماً }
اللهم صلِ وسلم على نبينا محمدﷺ

#يوم_Iلجمعه

Text_en:
{Indeed, God and His angels send blessings upon the Prophet. O you who have believed, bless him and grant him peace with complete salutation}
O Allah, bless and grant peace upon our Prophet Muhammad, may God bless him and grant him peace

#IdayFriday

{And do not think that those who are killed in the cause of God are dead. Rather, they are alive with their Lord, being provided for.} 
•
{And do not think that God is unaware of what the wrongdoers do. He only delays them for a day when eyes will be clear.}

#Al-Maamdani_Hospital Massacre
